Error [E2425]: Function `value` promises `Never` but returns a value.
  --> tests/ui/never_return_value.jet:2:12
    |
  2 |     return 1
    |            ^
 Why: A declared `Never` return has no success value (D-NEVER2=B).
 Fix: Remove the value and diverge, or change the return type.
